# 二进制文件标注——避免 git 对二进制做文本 diff / 换行转换
*.qgz binary
*.dump binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.msi binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.db binary

# 换行：hook 脚本必须 LF（否则 Git Bash 执行报 "\r: command not found"）；批处理用 CRLF
scripts/hooks/* text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.sh  text eol=lf
